      "text": "Sub: Filling up the post of Joint Director earmarked for Indian Police Service (IPS)\nofficers under Non-Central Staffing Scheme of the MoEF&CC in Wildlife Crime\nControl Bureau HQ, New Delhi in WCCB-reg."
